    "text": "We're excited to welcome our sponsors to the Berkeley Space Symposium on September 11 at the Grimes Engineering Center! This year's sponsors span the breadth of the space industry, from national labs and government research ( NASA - National Aeronautics and Space Administration , Lawrence Livermore National Laboratory , Air Force Research Laboratory ) to launch and satellite companies ( Rocket Lab , Astra , Vast , Apex - Satellite Platforms , Redwire , Astranis Space Technologies , Samara Aerospace , General Astronautics , Momentus ), tech companies ( Amazon , Microsoft , IonQ ), and research and materials partners ( Space Sciences Laboratory , ERG Aerospace ). Building on last year's turnout of 600+ students, 150+ industry professionals, and 20+ companies, BSS 2026 will once again bring together students and industry leaders for a day of keynotes, panels, speed mentoring, and a career fair. Come visit our sponsors' tables on September 11 to learn about their work and the opportunities they offer. Thank you to each of them for making this event possible. Register for free: https://lnkd.in/gtJCCnTf #BerkeleySpaceSymposium #Aerospace #UCBerkeley",
